@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+# source/batches/BATCH-DIFFERENTIAL-0001
+
+Source-side differential probe assets for the `omg-mcp-server`
+TypeScript-to-Python migration.
+
+- `probe.mjs` — executes `shared/batches/BATCH-DIFFERENTIAL-0001/corpus.json`
+  against the TypeScript source repository. Tool steps are exercised over the
+  real MCP stdio JSON-RPC surface of the compiled server (`dist/index.js`);
+  module steps import the compiled helpers from `dist/utils.js` and
+  `dist/state-tools.js`. Each case runs in a throwaway `WORKSPACE_ROOT`; the
+  probe never mutates the source repository.
+
+Usage (run by the INTEGRATION-owned `source/runner`):
+
+```
+node source/batches/BATCH-DIFFERENTIAL-0001/probe.mjs \
+  --corpus shared/batches/BATCH-DIFFERENTIAL-0001/corpus.json \
+  --fixtures fixtures/batches/BATCH-DIFFERENTIAL-0001 \
+  --server-dir <source-repo>/mcp-server \
+  --repo-root <source-repo> \
+  --output <report>
+```
+
+The probe emits `{batch_id, probe:"source", observations:[...]}`; the target
+probe emits the identical shape from the Python target. The grader asserts
+equality after normalization.
