+# source/batches/BATCH-P2P-0001
+
+Source-side P2P probe assets for `BATCH-P2P-0001`.
+
+`probe_p2p.mjs` executes against the unmodified TypeScript reference repository
+(`/input/source`). It consumes the shared corpus at
+`shared/batches/BATCH-P2P-0001/probes.json` and, per observation, emits:
+
+* `status` - the raw side result (`PASS`/`FAIL`);
+* `value` - the normalized projection shared with the target side.
+
+The harness entry point `source/runner` is intentionally **not** created here;
+it is owned exclusively by the INTEGRATION batch. This batch only contributes
+the probe module the runner invokes.
